{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13101230","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1310123001:0":{"text":"Ah, everyone, look!","source_cn":"啊，这是……你们看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2139CB4815144C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310123002:0":{"text":"Whoa! What's going on outside? Something's glowing real fierce.","source_cn":"嚯！外面怎么了，什么东西在绿油油地发光？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x155257CB4F5C481C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310123003:0":{"text":"It's not just glowing! That's a fire! Chippy will go put it out!","source_cn":"不是发光，是着火了！满满要去救火！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDDFD667CAE53331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1310123001":{"text":"Ah, everyone, look!","source_cn":"啊，这是……你们看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2139CB4815144C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310123004:0":{"text":"Fire's always red... Ah! Wait, that fire's green!","source_cn":"火当然是红色……哎呀！那里的火是绿色的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFAC11AD03462A0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Fire's always red... Ah! Wait, that fire's green!","female":"Fire's always red... Ah! Wait, that fire's green!","variant_male_record_index":"144484","variant_female_record_index":"144485","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310123007:0":{"text":"Could it really be like what Faramor said—that unnatural things happen after nightfall?","source_cn":"难道真像法拉莫尔先生说的，入夜以后那里出现了异变？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30AAADF1C849247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310123008:0":{"text":"Then... what should we do?","source_cn":"那……主人，我们该怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x05412FA0048D4DB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then... what should we do?","female":"Then... what should we do?","variant_male_record_index":"144491","variant_female_record_index":"144492","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310123006":{"text":"Oh, right! The fire is green!","source_cn":"对哦，这是绿色的火！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x519375D585E007AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh, right! The fire is green!","female":"Oh, right! The fire is green!","variant_male_record_index":"144488","variant_female_record_index":"144489","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310123011:0":{"text":"Maybe Faramor will be back soon!","source_cn":"嗯，先别慌，说不定法拉莫尔先生很快就会回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98850B844170450D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1310123012:0":{"text":"Time drags on, but there's still no sign of Faramor returning.","source_cn":"时间一分一秒过去，但法拉莫尔却迟迟未归","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57CECDEF77C17102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310123013:0":{"text":"We can't wait any longer! What if there are tons of undead? Faramor's strong, but he's still just one guy!","source_cn":"不行不行，不能再等下去了。万一有很多活死人呢？就算法拉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D95A2819BD2A9D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310123014:0":{"text":"Magister, we can't just sit here and do nothing!","source_cn":"主人，这种时候，我们可不能什么都不做！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C4A8DB56E26519D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, we can't just sit here and do nothing!","female":"Magister, we can't just sit here and do nothing!","variant_male_record_index":"144499","variant_female_record_index":"144500","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1310123012":{"text":"Time drags on, but there's still no sign of Faramor returning.","source_cn":"时间一分一秒过去，但法拉莫尔却迟迟未归","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57CECDEF77C17102","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1310123015:0":{"text":"Then let's go! It's pitch black out there, but we gotta try to find him...","source_cn":"那我们现在就行动！天这么黑，希望还能找到法拉莫尔……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x28D2AD658AB8C90A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then let's go! It's pitch black out there, but we gotta try to find him...","female":"Then let's go! It's pitch black out there, but we gotta try to find him...","variant_male_record_index":"144501","variant_female_record_index":"144502","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"I agree.","source_cn":"满满说得有理","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x551E9E619DF7278A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I agree.","female":"I agree.","variant_male_record_index":"68620","variant_female_record_index":"68621","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"Let's wait a bit longer.","source_cn":"沉住气，再等一会","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A14B521C61003AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's wait a bit longer.","female":"Let's wait a bit longer.","variant_male_record_index":"68616","variant_female_record_index":"68617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310123009:0":{"text":"I know how you feel, but Faramor warned us over and over not to go outside. It's like he knew something like this would happen...","source_cn":"可是，法拉莫尔先生再三强调不要出门，他似乎预料到会有这...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F46046504765551","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I know how you feel, but Faramor warned us over and over not to go outside. It's like he knew something like this would happen...","female":"I know how you feel, but Faramor warned us over and over not to go outside. It's like he knew something like this wou